     "rationale": "Onboarding healthcare.lab_results, version 1, from sample lab_results_20261019.csv (30 rows, UTF-8, comma-delimited, 8 columns, no empty values). Layout copied from healthcare.claims. Rules come from the diff: result_id pattern from shape AA999999 and unique key; patient_ref pattern from shape aa-9999; loinc_code pattern from shapes 9999-9 and 999-9; result_value decimal with one decimal place (shapes 99.9, 9.9, 999.9); unit pattern for shapes aa/aA, a/aA and %; abnormal_flag allowed H, L, N. PHI: patient_ref (links to a person) and ordering_provider (a clinician's name) are marked phi: true. Loosening: none (new contract). Dry run: 30 accepted, 0 rejected. Items for a person to confirm: owner, source channels, expected_arrival and classification are placeholders copied from claims, not vendor-specific facts. The unit pattern is inferred from three shapes only, since no code list was given. Nothing in the file asked for any contract change."
